1 NOTE {geni:about_me} * '''RETTELSE:: She Married Hans Rudolph`s SON Hans Adolph Juel'''
2 CONT **
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Amalie Christiane von Krogh''', was born on 7 May 1799. She died on 6 Apr 1858. She married Hans Rudolph Juel af Hverringe til Stamhuset Hverringe & Stamhuset Juelsberg on 28 Mar 1829.
2 CONT
