1 NOTE {geni:about_me} ==Biography==
2 CONT '''Catharine Brügmann''' was born on January 14, 1709. Her parents were [https://www.geni.com/profile-34621879211 Godske Hans von Brügmann, til Østergaard og Ulriksholm] and [https://www.geni.com/profile-31824739 Margrethe Wilhelm
2 CONC ine von Hausmann]. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Catharine married [https://www.geni.com/profile-31836777 Ulrich Frederik von Heinen, til Ulriksholm]. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Together they had the following children:
2 CONT * [https://www.geni.com/profile-117215819 Caspar Herman von Heinen, 1];
2 CONT * [https://www.geni.com/profile-129420129 Margrethe von Heinen, 2];
2 CONT * [https://www.geni.com/profile-34649076689 Frederika Maria von Heinen, 5];
2 CONT * [https://www.geni.com/profile-31836776 Ulrica Hedevig von Heinen, 4];
2 CONT * [https://www.geni.com/profile-34649076534 Catharine Vilhelmine von Heinen, 3];
2 CONT * [https://www.geni.com/profile-68924283 Albertine Christine von Heinen];
2 CONT * [https://www.geni.com/profile-34649076861 Albrecht Christopher von Heinen]. 
2 CONT
2 CONT She died on June 1, 1790. 
2 CONT ----
