2 CONT English translation: "Finn Holbek states: The Naturalized Line.1779 Second Lieutenant a 'la' suite in the Holstein Cavalry Regiment. 1789 Premiere Lieutenant. 1803 Major in Sjællandske Landeværns Regiment and commander of the 6th 
