2 CONT
2 CONT * wikisilkeborg.dk: [http://www.wikisilkeborg.dk/index.php/Kroghs_B%C3%A6nk Kroghs Bænk]
2 CONT
2 CONT ===Folketælling===
2 CONT
2 CONT FT-1835 - Haderslev, Aastrup, Nygaard einzelne Hufenstelle, Oberförster Dienstwohnung, 1
2 CONT
2 CONT Navn - Alder - Civilstand - Stilling i husstanden - Erhverv - Fødested
2 CONT
2 CONT # Friederich Ferdinand von Krogh - 55 - Verheir. - Cammerherr und Jägermeister	
2 CONT # Johanna Sophie von Warnstedt - 51 - Verheir. - dessen Gemahlinn	
2 CONT # Maria Juliane von Krogh - 27 - Unverheir. - deren Tochter Closter Fräulein
2 CONT
2 CONT FT-1845 - Haderslev, Aastrup, Ob. Aastrup, Hufengebäude, 46 a
2 CONT
2 CONT Navn - Alder - Civilstand - Stilling i husstanden - Erhverv - Fødested
2 CONT
2 CONT # Hanna Sophia v. Krogh	63 	Enke		Gemahlin des Oberforstmeister v. Krogh	
2 CONT
2 CONT ===Note===
2 CONT
2 CONT In the city Silkeborg (Jutland) there is a Kroghsvej, named after Frederik Ferdinand von Krogh 1780-1844. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Kroghs Bænk i Vesterskov is a 45 meter high vantage point in Vesterskov on the south side of Almindingen Lake. 
2 CONT
2 CONT The place is named after overførster Frederik Ferdinand von Krogh (1780-1844), who during the period 1825-1834 was having inspection of the state forests and therefore had the Silkeborgwoods under his supervision.
2 CONT
2 CONT Any particular reason why this viewpoint is named after Krogh, is not known. The name Krogh's Bench is seen on the map from 1860, but in "The Topographie of Silkeborg and its environs" in 1863 it is called "Krogh Memorial".
