1 NOTE {geni:about_me} '''Alida von Krogh (von Bolton)'''
2 CONT
2 CONT Alida was the daughter of the Mayor of Bremen, Germany.
2 CONT
2 CONT Children of Alida von Bolten and Bernhardus von Krogh are: 
2 CONT
2 CONT Georg Friderich von Krogh, b. 1653 in Trondheim, Norway d. 24 Oct 1721, BERGEN, NORWAY1690.
2 CONT
2 CONT Anna Dorothea von Krogh, b. 1658, Trondheim, Norway
2 CONT
2 CONT Helene Abigael von Krogh, b. 1660, Trondheim, Norway
2 CONT
2 CONT Believed to be daughter:
2 CONT
2 CONT Catharine Marie von Krogh - b. 5 jan. 1669 d. 23 apr. 1728 
