2 CONT Nygårdvej 4, 6100 Haderslev, Danmark
2 CONT
2 CONT Nygård er den ene af to herregårde i området (den anden er Åstrupgård). Nygårds fredede hovedbygning er opført år 1700. Avlslængerne er overvejende fra omkring år 1800, men delvis ombyggede ca. 100 år senere. Et lille charmerende 
2 CONC og meget velbevaret herregårdsanlæg.
2 CONT
2 CONT ------------------------------------------------------
2 CONT
2 CONT Fraulein Marie von Krogh (spoken of in the letters as Mie), the daughter of Geheimrath von Krogh; married in 1838 Ludwig  von Moltke, who in 1841 having an official appointment (as Amtmann, or governor), at Fehmarn, he moved to Bu
2 CONC rg, where he lived for eight years in the quiet exercise of his functions, to his own advantage and that of the little island he governed. There two sons and four daughters were born; both the boys unfortunately died young.
2 CONT
2 CONT * Letters of Field-Marshal Count Helmuth Von Moltke to His Mother: [http://books.google.ca/books?id=-agKAAAAIAAJ&lpg=PA98&ots=Yah-IqLl9a&dq=Fraulein%20Marie%20von%20Krogh&pg=PA98#v=onepage&q=Fraulein%20Marie%20von%20Krogh&f=false 
2 CONC Fraulein Marie von Krogh]
