1 NOTE {geni:about_me} ==Biography==
2 CONT '''Anna Sofia Jensdatter Wissing''' was born circa 1692. Her parents were [https://www.geni.com/profile-4372885 Jens Jensen Wissing, til Aarhus Mølle] and [https://www.geni.com/profile-34631400120 Martha Elisabeth Meulengracht]. S
2 CONC he was a 1739 enke efter Peder Benzon, konferensråd. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Anna Sofia married [https://www.geni.com/profile-118715646 Peder Benzon, til Vaar & Gjeddesdal]. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Together they had the following children:
2 CONT * [https://www.geni.com/profile-34664117706 Niels Benzon]; 
2 CONT * [https://www.geni.com/profile-34664117718 Frederik Benzon]; 
2 CONT * [https://www.geni.com/profile-34665549391 Anna Elisabeth Benzon]; 
2 CONT * [https://www.geni.com/profile-34664117790 Jens Benzon]; 
2 CONT * [https://www.geni.com/profile-68924198 Christian von Benzon til Stamhuset Cathrineberg & Stamhuset Christiansdal]. 
2 CONT
2 CONT She died on September 12, 1762. 
2 CONT ----
