1 NOTE {geni:about_me} ==Biography==
2 CONT '''Gisella Pape Hausmann''' was born circa 1649. Her parents were [https://www.geni.com/profile-31824889 Daniel Hausmann] and [https://www.geni.com/profile-3024187 Margarethe von Pape, Friherreinde af Løvendal]. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Gisella married [https://www.geni.com/profile-34636193486 Nicolaus Brügmann, til Ulriksholm, Adelsbrev 13/2 1680] in 1665. Together they had the following children:
2 CONT * [https://www.geni.com/profile-34648680088 Daniel von Brügmann]; 
2 CONT * [https://www.geni.com/profile-34648680012 Gesilla von Brügemann]; 
2 CONT * [https://www.geni.com/profile-34648680078 Christian Brügemann]; 
2 CONT * [https://www.geni.com/profile-34648679836 Drude Brüggemann]; 
2 CONT * [https://www.geni.com/profile-34636827230 Ulrik Frederik von Brüggemann, Oberst]; 
2 CONT * [https://www.geni.com/profile-114443433 Margrethe Brüggemann]. 
2 CONT
2 CONT She died on November 13, 1672 in Segeberg, Schleswig-Holstein and was buried on November 19, 1672. 
2 CONT ----
