1 NAME Jens /von Benzon/
2 GIVN Jens
2 _MARNM von Benzon
1 SEX M
1 BIRT
2 DATE 1 JUN 1767
2 ADDR
3 CITY Odense Købstad
3 CTRY Danmark
1 DEAT
2 DATE 24 DEC 1839
2 ADDR
3 CITY Odense Købstad
3 CTRY Danmark
1 OCCU Kammerherre, Judge- Supreme Court
1 NOTE {geni:about_me} http://www.skislekt.no/adel/Anetavle/aner0001.htm#id113
2 CONT      194  vii.   Jens Benzon (132) was born den 1 jun 1767. Han married Antoinette Margaretha Gersdorff (133), datter av Kammerherre Poul Rosenørn Gersdorff (405) og Georgine Wilhelmine de Pogrell (406), den 9 jul 1800. Han died d
2 CONC en 24 des 1839 72 år gammel. Han witnessed Amtmand, en Søn af Oberstlieutenant Christian B. (f 1801), blev født i Odense i. Juni 1767, studerede ved Sorø Akademi fra 1784-88, blev 1790 Avskultant i Generaltoldkammeret, 1791 Kammer
2 CONC junker, 1794 Vice-Lands-dommer ved Fynbo Landsting, 1800 Assessor i Højesteret, 1801 Amtmand over Randers Amt, entledigedes efter eget Ønske paa Grund af Øjensvaghed 1805, tog derefter Ophold i Odense, hvor han bl. a. virkede for 
2 CONC Oprettelsen af en Sparekasse, ligesom han allerede tidligere havde arbejdet for Fængselsvæsenets bedre Indretning i Fyn, blev 1826 Kammerherre, var Medlem af den Forsamling af oplyste Mænd, der 1832 bleve sammenkaldte til at drøft
2 CONC e forskjellige, Provinsialstænderne vedrørende Forhold, oprettede 1836 det Benzonske Familielegat og døde i Odense 24. Dec. 1839. Han har skrevet forskjellige mindre Afhandlinger. 1797 blev han gift med Antoinette Margrethe Gersdo
2 CONC rff (f. 24. April 1773 † 31- Maj 1834), en Datter af Gehejmeraad, Stiftamtmand Poul Rosenørn G. til Vosnæsgaard (f. 1745 † 1810) og Georgine Vilhelmine f. Pogrell (f. 1746 † 1775).
2 CONT
2 CONT Notes for Kammerherre, Judge Supreme Jens Benzon. He married Antoinette Margaretha Gersdorff (133), daughter av chamberlain Poul Rosenørn Gersdorff (405) and Georgina Wilhelmine da Pogrell (406), it 9 Christmas 1800. He died 24 th
2 CONC e 1838 72 years oldly. He witnesses Prefect, a Son of Oberslieutenant Christian B. (F1801, was born in Odense in. June 1767, Studied at Sorø  Akademi from 1784-88, 1790 Avskultant became in Generaltoldkammeret, 1791 a Chamber youn
2 CONC g nobleman, 1794 a Vice-Lands-judge near Fynbo Landsting, 1800 a Judge in Supreme Court, 1801 a Prefect over Randers Amt, whee entlidiged after self-owned Wish paa Ground by Øjensvaghed 1805, took after that Stay in Odense, where 
2 CONC he worked for the Foundation of a Savings bank among other things, just as he already earlier had worked for Faengselsvaesenet's better Arrangement in Funen, became 1826 a Chamberlain, was Member of that Gathering of enlightened M
2 CONC en that 1832 bleve summonned to discuss different, Provinsialstaenderne concerning Condition, established it 1836 Benzonske Familielegat and died in Odense 24.Dec 1839. He has written different small Treatises. 1797 he was married
2 CONC  off wih Antoinette Margrethe Gersdorff (b.24.April 1773 died 31 May 1834), a the daughter of Gehejmeraad, Prefect Poul Rosenørn G. for Vosnaesgaard (b.1745 died 1810) and Georgina Vilhelmine b.Pogrell (b.1746 died 1775)   (Source
2 CONC : Ettersleke av Magdalena Cathrine Adler (268)   http://www.skislekt.no/adel/Anetavle/aner0001.htm)
