1 NOTE {geni:about_me} To America.
2 CONT
2 CONT https://www.findagrave.com/memorial/92562994/louise_marie-froiland
2 CONT
2 CONT CHILDREN: Elwin J. Froiland (30 Dec 1908 - 27 Sep 1998), Irwin H. Froiland (12 May 1910 - Jul 1984), Ovidia M. Tompkins, and Lloyd Froiland
2 CONT
2 CONT Mrs. Hans (Louise) Froiland, 92, died May 10 in the Griggs County Nursing Home, where she had been a resident for some time.
2 CONT Funeral services were held Monday in Bethlehem Free Church, Cooperstown, with burial in the Westley Cemetery.
2 CONT Louise Carstens was born July 4, 1885 at Tryseil, Norway, and came to the United States in 1904. She worked in Fargo for a short time before coming to Cooperstown. She was married to Hans Froiland here in 1907. They farmed until t
2 CONC heir retirement. In 1941 they moved to Cooperstown. Mr. Froiland died in 1955.
2 CONT Mrs. Froiland is survived by a daughter, Mrs. Harold (Ovidia) Tomkins, Coto De Coza, California; three sons, Elwin of Mesa, Arizona, Lloyd, Pomona, California and Irwin, Cooperstown; 11 grandchildren and 15 great-grandchildren.
2 CONT Quam-Plaisted Funeral Homes.
2 CONT Published in the Griggs County Sentinel-Courier, Cooperstown, North Dakota, May 17, 1978.
2 CONT Submitted by Dennis C. Olson #48363213
